    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# STEP 9: FINAL TEST-SET CALIBRATION EVALUATION\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# IMPORTANT:\n",
    "# The TEST dataset has NOT been used for:\n",
    "#   - model training\n",
    "#   - model selection\n",
    "#   - isotonic calibration\n",
    "#\n",
    "# Therefore, this is our first unbiased evaluation of whether\n",
    "# calibration improves probability quality on unseen data.\n",
    "#\n",
    "# We compare:\n",
    "#   1. Raw Gradient Boosting probabilities\n",
    "#   2. Isotonic-calibrated probabilities\n",
    "#\n",
